#. type: Title =
#: pages/foa.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fedora Operations Architect"
msgstr "Fedora Operations Architect"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/foa.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The Fedora Operations Architect (FOA) is employed full-time by Red Hat to "
"assist the community in managing technical change.  This includes change "
"wrangling, schedule management, communications, and ownership of key "
"strategic efforts.  The Operations Architect also serves as a member of the "
"Fedora Council.  This role was created in 2023."
msgstr ""
"Fedora Operations Architect (FOA) är heltidsanställd av Red Hat för att "
"hjälpa gemenskapen att hantera tekniska förändringar. Detta omfattar "
"hantering av Changes, schemahantering, kommunikation och ansvar för centrala"
" strategiska initiativ. Operations Architect är även medlem av Fedora "
"Council. Rollen skapades 2023."

#. type: Title ==
#: pages/foa.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Current Fedora Operations Architect"
msgstr "Nuvarande Fedora Operations Architect"

#. type: Positional ($1) AttributeList argument for macro 'image'
#: pages/foa.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Aoife Moloney (she/her)"
msgstr "Aoife Moloney (hon/henne)"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: pages/foa.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "amoloney.png"
msgstr "amoloney.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/foa.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Aoife Moloney is the current FOA.  She is based in Waterford, Ireland and "
"has been using Fedora Linux since 2018 when she joined the Red Hat "
"xref:cle::index.adoc[Community Linux Engineering team].  There, she served "
"as a project manager, product owner, and general “cat herder”."
msgstr ""
"Aoife Moloney är nuvarande FOA. Hon bor i Waterford på Irland och har använt"
" Fedora Linux sedan 2018, då hon gick med i Red Hats "
"xref:cle::index.adoc[Community Linux Engineering-team]. Där arbetade hon som"
" projektledare, produktägare och allmän ”kattherde”."

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/foa.adoc:24
msgid ""
"You can find Aoife on chat.fedoraproject.org as `@amoloney:fedora.im`, and "
"she is happy to talk about anything."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar Aoife på chat.fedoraproject.org som `@amoloney:fedora.im`; hon "
"pratar gärna om vad som helst."

#. type: Title ==
#: pages/foa.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Responsibilities"
msgstr "Ansvar"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/foa.adoc:30
msgid ""
"The Fedora Operations Architect is primarily responsible for coordinating "
"technical change in the project.  They work closely with a number of groups "
"across the Fedora Project and have a range of responsibilities in each."
msgstr ""
"Fedora Operations Architect ansvarar främst för att samordna tekniska "
"förändringar i projektet. Rollen samarbetar nära med flera grupper i Fedora-"
"projektet och har olika ansvarsområden inom var och en."

#. type: Title ===
#: pages/foa.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage the Changes Process "
msgstr "Hantera Changes-processen "

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/foa.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Shepherd Change proposals through the "
"xref:program_management::changes_policy.adoc[Changes process]"
msgstr ""
"Leda Change-förslag genom "
"xref:program_management::changes_policy.adoc[Changes-processen]"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/foa.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Send reminders about upcoming deadlines in the release cycle for changes"
msgstr ""
"Skicka påminnelser om kommande tidsfrister för Changes i utgivningscykeln"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/foa.adoc:38
msgid "Create tracker issues for accepted changes"
msgstr "Skapa spårningsärenden för godkända Changes"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/foa.adoc:39
msgid "Track the status of Changes during the development/testing cycle"
msgstr "Följ statusen för Changes under utvecklings- och testcykeln"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/foa.adoc:40
msgid "Create and submit the Incomplete Changes Report to FESco"
msgstr "Skapa och skicka rapporten över ofullständiga Changes till FESco"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/foa.adoc:41
msgid "Maintain the Change Set Pages"
msgstr "Underhåll Change Set-sidorna"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/foa.adoc:42
msgid "Manage the Spins and Labs Keepalive process"
msgstr "Hantera Keepalive-processen för Spins och Labs"

