#. type: Title ==
#: pages/foa.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "History"
msgstr "Historik"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/foa.adoc:114
msgid ""
"This is a new role for Fedora, https://fedoramagazine.org/introducing-"
"fedora-operations-architect/[as of October 2023]."
msgstr ""
"Det här är en ny roll för Fedora, https://fedoramagazine.org/introducing-"
"fedora-operations-architect/[från oktober 2023]."

#. type: Title ===
#: pages/foa.adoc:116
#, no-wrap
msgid "What about Fedora Program Manager (FPgM)?"
msgstr "Vad hände med Fedora Program Manager (FPgM)?"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/foa.adoc:121
msgid ""
"In 2007, Red Hat began providing Fedora with assistance through a funded "
"role in the company’s Program Management organization.  In 2023, structural "
"changes at the company eliminated this position.  The Fedora Operations "
"Architect is a new role situated in Linux Engineering at Red Hat, designed "
"to be more closely aligned in both definition and practice with Fedora’s "
"unique needs."
msgstr ""
"År 2007 började Red Hat hjälpa Fedora genom en finansierad roll i företagets"
" Program Management-organisation. År 2023 avvecklades denna tjänst genom "
"strukturella förändringar i företaget. Fedora Operations Architect är en ny "
"roll inom Linux Engineering på Red Hat, utformad för att i både definition "
"och praktik stämma bättre överens med Fedoras särskilda behov."

